    sd:notes "Confirmed by viewing: 'Add New Position' form (Type, Category, Position, Building, Approved FTE, Status dropdown defaulting Active) — direct visual match for 18.1.1/18.1.2." ;
    sd:definedIn staff:Fdd18Doc .
