    sd:section "abox/mied-v3/fdd-review/18-roster-of-positions/wireframes/wireframe-03-position-details-delete.png" ;
    sd:notes "Confirmed by viewing: Position Details tab (Approved FTE, Building, Status editable fields) with a 'This position has not been reported in any collection...' note and a 'Delete Position' button — direct visual match for 18.2.1 and 18.2.3's working-window-only delete gate." ;
